Z||000001||jelly2m8||10-24-2001||06:57 PM||||That chat doesn't seem real active.<P> There is a Fiero Owners Online Chat that is open 24/7, with today ( wednesday ) being the "main" night.<P>You can find fellow fiero-ites here every evening, usually during the days too. it's a great place for online chat. We have a pretty impressive knowledgeable group in there. <BR> <A HREF="http://www.fierodrivers.com/chat/" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fierodrivers.com/chat/</A> <P> Heres a link which has directions to get to the Fiero Owners Online Chat. Use a IRC chat client if possible, it's a great way to share pictures, direct chat, transfer files, much the same way ICQ does.<P> If not, try the JAVA IRC CHAT CLIENT. It's not as fancy as mIRC for example, but it does work.<BR> Drop by and have a chat, if no one replies immediately, dont leave, because we are around. <P> We are the ONLY dedicated online Fiero chat. We have been online for at least 3 years ( when I started in there).<P> you never know who will show up there, v8 Archie makes an appearance by times, I've seen LT1 ChopTop in there occasionally, and Skitime joined in last week.<P> Hope to see you there soon!<BR> ||||reg||1
